        "title": "Zero-ETL Analytics Platform",
        "slug": "zero-etl-analytics-platform",
        "summary": "An analytics dashboard that queries data where it lives: live Postgres tables joined with Parquet logs in object storage, through DuckDB, with no copy pipeline.",
        "description": "In progress. A federated analytics platform: instead of an ETL pipeline that copies data everywhere, DuckDB queries the application database and the raw logs in place and joins them for one dashboard. The aim is to keep data movement and egress costs low.",
        "kind": "personal",
        "category": "Data analytics",
        "year": "2026, in progress",
        "role": "Sole author",
        "technologies": [
