            "heading": "The design",
            "items": [
              {
                "title": "Sources",
                "text": "PostgreSQL (Supabase) for live user profiles, and raw web logs stored as Parquet files in S3-compatible storage (MinIO locally)."
              },
              {
                "title": "Engine",
                "text": "DuckDB reads both in place and acts as the semantic and transformation layer: no warehouse to load first."
              },
              {
                "title": "Dashboard",
